 (yield mayFail1().pipe(
 Either.mapLeft((e) => aborted by an error from 1st function, ${e}),
 )) +
 (yield mayFail2().pipe(
 Either.mapLeft((e) => aborted by an error from 2nd function, ${e}),
 ))
 …

注意：使用 Either.gen 时，你不需要用 Either.right 包装最终值。生成器的返回值会成为 Right。

